### 3. Clear Communication in English
Our certified tutors explain the rules of Tajweed (such as *Ikhfa*, *Idgham*, and *Qalqalah*) using clear English terminology that kids can easily grasp and remember.

## Building a Lasting Connection to the Quran

The ultimate goal of learning Tajweed is to help your child feel connected to their faith with clarity and confidence. When a child learns to recite correctly without struggling over words, reading the Quran becomes a source of calm rather than a chore.

At Abraham Online Academy, our male and female Tajweed tutors work patiently with students of all ages, helping them master recitation step-by-step from the comfort of home.` // Paste full markdown text here
